 "notes": "The full Prophet-5 modulation (Sequential Prophet-5 User’s Guide): Poly Mod (filter envelope and oscillator B into oscillator A’s frequency, pulse width and the filter, per voice, at audio rate) and Wheel-Mod (LFO / noise mix into both frequencies, both pulse widths and the filter), oscillator A’s saw and pulse together, oscillator B’s keyboard switch and lo freq. Five voices, as the original."
